# Secrets - added 2026-07-25.
# mosquitto/config/pwfile is the Mosquitto password file (uid 1883, mode 0600).
# It is unreadable to the backup user, which made `git add` die fatal and silently
# killed every backup for 5.5 months. A password file must never be in a git repo
# that is pushed to GitHub, so it is untracked here rather than read with sudo.
mosquitto/config/pwfile
